# AI-Driven Enterprise Project Intelligence & Risk Management Platform
# Milestone 1 environment configuration template.
#
# Milestone 1's pipeline (ingestion, chunking, embedding, indexing,
# retrieval) runs entirely locally and does not call any external API,
# so no keys are required to run the application as-is.
#
# This file is a placeholder for later milestones, which may introduce
# an LLM-based generation step (e.g. for the conversational assistant)
# or another external service. Copy this file to ".env" and fill in
# values if/when such a dependency is added - "load_dotenv()" should be
# called at application startup once ".env" exists.

# Example for a future milestone (not required / not used by Milestone 1):
# LLM_API_KEY=

# Directory where the Chroma vector database is persisted.
CHROMA_PERSIST_DIRECTORY=chroma_db
